## In your territory, what are the 3 most significant Business Service Sector trends for 2023?

*   Multiculturalism: The business services sector in Poland is characterized by its multicultural workforce, with employees from 50 countries providing services in 35 languages. English is the dominant language, spoken by the majority of employees. This diversity brings a unique mix of perspectives and ideas to the sector.
*   Adaptability: The ability to adapt quickly to changing circumstances will be crucial for the further development of organizations in 2023. Rigid structures and long-term plans are no longer effective in a constantly evolving environment. Flexibility and adaptability will be key to success.
*   Remote work: Remote work has become a strong trend in the Polish labour market, with many companies adopting hybrid work models. This has allowed employees to work from anywhere and has opened up opportunities to work for companies around the world without the need for relocation. The quick adaptation to remote work has brought increased efficiency and cost savings for companies.

