*   Focus on employer branding: Pay attention to the cultural aspect and properly represent your employer brand. Hiring managers should be well-prepared to build a positive image of your business during candidate interviews. Employer branding plays a crucial role in attracting and retaining top talent in Poland.
*   Establish strong partnerships: Instead of multiplying suppliers, focus on building strong partnerships with a few trusted and verified partners. Trust, and understanding expectations are key to efficient and smooth operations, including recruitment processes.

